        "title": "DISCHARGE PLAN",
        "content": "1. Discharge destination: Discharge <CIT id=\"c23\">home with father</CIT>.\n2. Medications:\n Please continue <CIT id=\"c21\">Propanolol 10mg daily</CIT>.\n Please continue <CIT id=\"c22\">Escitalopram 20mg daily</CIT>.\n Please continue prescribed <CIT id=\"c17\">oral antibiotics</CIT> as directed.\n3. Follow-up arrangements:\n Follow-up with your GP in 3-5 days for review of CAP.\n4. Safety netting:\n Please seek medical attention and/or present to your nearest emergency department if you experience:\n - Worsening cough or phlegm production\n - Increasing shortness of breath or difficulty breathing\n - Fevers or chills\n - Worsening chest pain\n - Dizziness or pre-syncope\nKind Regards, Dr [], [] []",
